      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If the content tagging system gets more use, parental control could just be a way to force enable specific content gating. But I guess we need more content label options then.\n\nBut since VRChat was going to implement (or have already) some content gating as default for accounts under a specific age, maybe the parental control wouldn't matter too much currently.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
