  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-04-12T20:01:07.242Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It's very obvious that many worlds in VRChat are made with NSFW activities in mind. Specific examples include \"JustBClub\" and \"FBT Heaven\". \nA tagging system should be put in place to label these worlds are such as well as some sort of parental control to disallow underage users into such worlds.\nWhether this manifest as a pin put in as parent or just entering a birthdate, some form of moderation would go a long way.",
